  itemName: Coat of royal punishers
  description: Many years ago, there was an order of Royal punishers who could deal
    with criminals in the cruelest ways without any consequences, and of course,
    they abused their powers. Later, the order was disbanded, but their paraphernalia
    remained in many places. This item provokes attacks on the unit wearing it more
    than on others, increasing its priority for the enemy by <b>10 points</b>.
